<item name='HFText'><text>Yes</text></item>
<item name='HelpECategories'><text>1. User Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Checking Project Status</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>1. Guide d'utilisation</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Vérification du statut financier d'un projet</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>1</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>3</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Part of the duties of a Principal Investigator (PI) is to ensure that the available funds for a project are spent to ensure the success of the project.  This database is a tool that will allow you to find this information quickly.  </run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>If you are a PI on a project, you will be identified as such for that project in the Admin area of the database.  This allows you to:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='93%' list='bullet'/>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>check on the financial status of the project</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>see who is has access to ordering on your project</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>It is your responsibility to ensure that budget information has been properly entered and to follow the spending on your project to prevent overspending.</run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpFHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Une des tâches du Chercheur Principal (CP) consiste à s'assurer que les fonds attribués à un projet sont dépensés de façon à garantir son succès. La base de données est un outil permettant de retracer rapidement toute information à ce sujet.</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Si vous êtes le CP d'un projet, la base de données vous identifiera comme tel dans la section administrative et vous permettra de :</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='1.0625in' rightmargin='93%' list='bullet'/>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>vérifier le statut financier du projet</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>identifier qui peut commander dans le cadre du projet</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Les CP doivent s'assurer que les informations concernant le budget sont entrées correctement. Ils doivent également effectuer le suivi des dépenses de leurs projets afin d'en prévenir les excès.</run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpESubject'><text>Roles and Responsibilities of Principal Investigators</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubject'><text>Rôles et responsabilités des chercheurs principaux</text></item></document>

